on**\n\nAll visual cues—stage with curtain, audience presence, costumed performers on a raised set, theatrical lighting, scripted interaction, and a near‑final bow—confirm the video is a live theatrical drama (musical) of *Aladdin*.', 'failed_images': [('/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/o-gLbgpzCc8/frames/frame_0000.jpg', 'File not found')]}
